    {"id":"lec2_search_graph_vs_tree","source_file":"ai_lec2_uninformed_search.pdf","page_start":17,"page_end":18,"section_title":"搜索图和搜索树","topic_ids":["tree_search_vs_graph_search"],"support_tags":["state_graph","state_transition","action_sequence"],"keywords":["搜索图","search graph","搜索树","state transition","行动序列"],"content":"课件将状态表示为搜索图中的节点、状态转移表示为边，并强调搜索算法考虑可能的行动序列；搜索树是展开这些序列的一种表示。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"comparison","review_status":"codex_draft"},
