    {"id":"lec2_graph_search_repeated_states","source_file":"ai_lec2_uninformed_search.pdf","page_start":27,"page_end":27,"section_title":"图搜索与重复状态","topic_ids":["tree_search_vs_graph_search","frontier_and_explored_set"],"support_tags":["visited_set","repeated_states","graph_search"],"keywords":["图搜索","graph search","重复状态","visited","explored set","树搜索"],"content":"课件对比树搜索和图搜索：树搜索不记忆访问状态，可能重复扩展；图搜索记忆访问状态，以避免重复扩展。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"comparison","review_status":"codex_draft"},
