    {"id":"lec2_bfs_properties","source_file":"ai_lec2_uninformed_search.pdf","page_start":35,"page_end":35,"section_title":"BFS 性能","topic_ids":["breadth_first_search","completeness_optimality_complexity"],"support_tags":["branching_factor","time_complexity","space_complexity"],"keywords":["BFS","时间复杂度","空间复杂度","完备性","O(b^d)","breadth-first"],"content":"课件给出 BFS 随分支因子和最浅目标深度增长的时间与空间需求，并标注其完备性；有关最优性的代价条件应结合单位或相等行动代价理解。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"complexity","review_status":"codex_draft"},
