    {"id":"lec3_informed_search_summary","source_file":"ai_lec3_informed_search.pdf","page_start":59,"page_end":59,"section_title":"有信息搜索小结","topic_ids":["informed_search_and_heuristics","a_star_search","admissibility_and_consistency"],"support_tags":["heuristic","g_cost","h_cost","relaxed_problem"],"keywords":["小结","启发式","A*","可采纳性","一致性","松弛问题"],"content":"课件总结启发式是对当前到目标路径消耗的估计；A* 同时考虑路径开销和估计，并将可采纳性与一致性列为树搜索和图搜索最优性条件。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"property","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec3_search_strategy_exercise","source_file":"ai_lec3_informed_search.pdf","page_start":60,"page_end":65,"section_title":"搜索策略课堂练习","topic_ids":["breadth_first_search","depth_first_search","uniform_cost_search","a_star_search"],"support_tags":["node_expansion","tie_breaking","path"],"keywords":["课堂练习","DFS","BFS","UCS","A*","节点扩展","路径"],"content":"课件练习要求在同一图上比较 DFS、BFS、UCS、贪婪搜索和 A* 的节点扩展顺序与返回路径，并给出各策略的示例答案。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"example","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec4_llm_search_test_time_scaling","source_file":"ai_lec4_local_search_and_llm_search.pdf","page_start":3,"page_end":5,"section_title":"LLM 搜索与测试时扩展","topic_ids":["llm_search_and_test_time_scaling"],"support_tags":["greedy_decoding","context_state","next_token_action","test_time_scaling"],"keywords":["LLM + Search","test-time scaling","贪心解码","context","next token"],"content":"课件把标准 LLM 的贪心解码与搜索增强推理对照，并将解码建模为搜索：当前上下文是状态、下一个 token 是动作、可能序列构成搜索空间。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"definition","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec4_llm_agent_planning","source_file":"ai_lec4_local_search_and_llm_search.pdf","page_start":6,"page_end":8,"section_title":"搜索增强 LLM Agent 规划","topic_ids":["llm_search_and_test_time_scaling","depth_first_search"],"support_tags":["agent_planning","travel_planning","point_of_interest","dfs"],"keywords":["Agent规划","旅行规划","POI","LLM + DFS","constraints"],"content":"课件以旅行规划为例：LLM 理解需求后，可把下一兴趣点选择建模为预测问题，并结合 DFS 逐步探索可能行程，以生成满足约束的方案。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"application","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec4_local_search_state_neighbors","source_file":"ai_lec4_local_search_and_llm_search.pdf","page_start":9,"page_end":11,"section_title":"局部搜索与邻域","topic_ids":["local_search"],"support_tags":["neighborhood","candidate_state","evaluation_function","n_queens"],"keywords":["局部搜索","local search","邻域","neighborhood","N皇后","评估"],"content":"局部搜索适用于只关心最终状态是否达到目标、而不关心从初始状态出发的完整路径的问题；它评价当前状态邻域内的近邻解，并移动以获得更好的解。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"definition","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec4_hill_climbing","source_file":"ai_lec4_local_search_and_llm_search.pdf","page_start":12,"page_end":16,"section_title":"爬山法及其局限","topic_ids":["hill_climbing","local_search"],"support_tags":["best_neighbor","local_optimum","sideways_move","random_restart","stochastic"],"keywords":["爬山法","hill climbing","最优邻居","随机重启","随机游走","局部最优"],"content":"爬山法从初始状态开始，反复移动到邻域内最好的解；没有更好邻居时停止。课件同时讨论横向移动、随机重启、随机/首选变体，以及局部最优与随机游走效率之间的取舍。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"algorithm","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec4_simulated_annealing","source_file":"ai_lec4_local_search_and_llm_search.pdf","page_start":17,"page_end":19,"section_title":"模拟退火","topic_ids":["simulated_annealing","hill_climbing"],"support_tags":["temperature_schedule","randomness","non_improving_move","local_optimum"],"keywords":["模拟退火","simulated annealing","温度","随机性","后继状态"],"content":"课件把模拟退火描述为把爬山法与随机性结合：更优后继直接接受，较差后继可按概率接受；温度随时间变化，使早期随机性较强、后期较弱，以缓解爬山法陷入局部最优。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"algorithm","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec4_evolutionary_search_cycle","source_file":"ai_lec4_local_search_and_llm_search.pdf","page_start":20,"page_end":25,"section_title":"演化算法搜索循环","topic_ids":["evolutionary_search","local_search"],"support_tags":["population","fitness","selection","crossover","mutation"],"keywords":["演化算法","evolutionary algorithm","种群","适应度","选择","杂交","突变"],"content":"课件将搜索候选表示为种群中的个体：适应度高的个体更可能成为亲本；通过选择、杂交和随机突变产生后代，持续迭代以寻找更优解。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"algorithm","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec4_evolutionary_search_applications","source_file":"ai_lec4_local_search_and_llm_search.pdf","page_start":26,"page_end":27,"section_title":"演化搜索的应用与符号回归","topic_ids":["evolutionary_search"],"support_tags":["circuit_layout","job_shop_scheduling","neural_architecture_search","symbolic_regression"],"keywords":["电路布图","作业车间调度","神经网络架构搜索","符号回归"],"content":"课件列举演化算法在电路布图、作业车间调度和神经网络架构搜索中的应用，并以符号回归说明可通过候选公式的适应度、交叉和变异从观测数据中搜索方程。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"application","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec4_llm_guided_evolution","source_file":"ai_lec4_local_search_and_llm_search.pdf","page_start":28,"page_end":30,"section_title":"LLM 加速演化搜索","topic_ids":["llm_search_and_test_time_scaling","evolutionary_search"],"support_tags":["program_search","candidate_generation","deterministic_evaluation","llm_mutation"],"keywords":["LLM-SR","FunSearch","AlphaEvolve","程序搜索","LLM mutation"],"content":"课件的扩展示例将 LLM 用于生成候选程序或结构，再以确定性评估、适应度选择和历史优样本反馈驱动后续生成；这是 LLM 引导的搜索/演化流程，而非将 LLM 输出直接视为已验证答案。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"application","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec5_adversarial_game_model","source_file":"ai_lec5_adversarial_search.pdf","page_start":4,"page_end":12,"section_title":"对抗博弈与问题建模","topic_ids":["adversarial_search","search_problem_formulation"],"support_tags":["game_search","two_player","zero_sum","terminal_test","utility"],"keywords":["对抗搜索","博弈搜索","双人零和","状态","动作","终局得分"],"content":"课件将对抗搜索称为博弈搜索，并聚焦信息确定、完全可观察、轮流行动、收益零和的双人博弈。其问题建模包含局面与当前玩家、动作集合、状态转移、终局检测和终局得分。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"definition","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec5_game_tree_values","source_file":"ai_lec5_adversarial_search.pdf","page_start":9,"page_end":15,"section_title":"博弈树与最优策略","topic_ids":["adversarial_search","minimax_search"],"support_tags":["game_tree","max_player","min_player","terminal_utility","strategy"],"keywords":["博弈树","MAX","MIN","终局状态","最优策略","game tree"],"content":"课件对比单一 Agent 搜索树和博弈搜索树：部分状态由对手控制，终局状态有收益值；最优策略需要同时考虑己方和对手的选择。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"comparison","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec5_minimax_search","source_file":"ai_lec5_adversarial_search.pdf","page_start":16,"page_end":19,"section_title":"最小最大搜索","topic_ids":["minimax_search","adversarial_search"],"support_tags":["max_value","min_value","recursive_search","branching_factor","depth"],"keywords":["最小最大","minimax","MAX","MIN","递归","时间复杂度"],"content":"最小最大搜索在终局返回 utility；MAX 节点选择后继中的最大值，MIN 节点选择最小值。课件指出其递归形式与 DFS 类似，分支因子和搜索深度会使精确搜索在棋类中难以实行。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"algorithm","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec5_alpha_beta_pruning","source_file":"ai_lec5_adversarial_search.pdf","page_start":20,"page_end":31,"section_title":"Alpha-Beta 剪枝","topic_ids":["alpha_beta_pruning","minimax_search"],"support_tags":["alpha","beta","cutoff","bounds","move_ordering"],"keywords":["Alpha-Beta","剪枝","alpha","beta","MAX","MIN","cutoff"],"content":"Alpha-Beta 剪枝在搜索路径上维护 MAX 已知最佳选择的下界 alpha 与 MIN 已知最佳选择的上界 beta；当界限表明未访问后继不会影响上层决策时即可剪枝。课件给出相应递归伪代码。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"algorithm","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec5_alpha_beta_ordering","source_file":"ai_lec5_adversarial_search.pdf","page_start":35,"page_end":35,"section_title":"Alpha-Beta 的搜索顺序","topic_ids":["alpha_beta_pruning"],"support_tags":["move_ordering","successor_sorting","chess"],"keywords":["搜索顺序","后继排序","Alpha-Beta","象棋","吃子"],"content":"课件强调搜索顺序影响 Alpha-Beta 剪枝效果，并以象棋中的吃子、威胁、前进和后退排序作为后继状态排序方案的例子。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"property","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec5_game_state_evaluation","source_file":"ai_lec5_adversarial_search.pdf","page_start":36,"page_end":38,"section_title":"资源受限下的评估函数","topic_ids":["game_state_evaluation","alpha_beta_pruning"],"support_tags":["depth_limit","nonterminal_state","weighted_features","chess","go"],"keywords":["评估函数","非终止节点","加权线性函数","棋局特征","围棋"],"content":"课件指出即使使用 Alpha-Beta，搜索到终局的深度仍可能不现实；可为非终止状态设计评估函数，将棋子等特征按权重组合。围棋的大分支因子和评估设计困难说明了这一限制。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"definition","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec6_monte_carlo_estimation","source_file":"ai_lec6_mcts_and_search_summary.pdf","page_start":6,"page_end":13,"section_title":"蒙特卡洛模拟与状态估计","topic_ids":["monte_carlo_search","game_state_evaluation"],"support_tags":["random_sampling","simulation","win_rate","state_value"],"keywords":["蒙特卡洛","Monte Carlo","随机抽样","模拟","胜率","状态价值"],"content":"课件将蒙特卡洛方法说明为依赖重复随机抽样获得数值结果；在围棋例子中，从状态出发反复模拟，并以模拟胜率估计状态好坏。有限资源下还需要决定将模拟预算分配给哪些节点。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"definition","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec6_exploration_exploitation","source_file":"ai_lec6_mcts_and_search_summary.pdf","page_start":14,"page_end":18,"section_title":"探索与利用","topic_ids":["exploration_exploitation","monte_carlo_search"],"support_tags":["multi_armed_bandit","epsilon_greedy","softmax","reward_estimate"],"keywords":["探索","利用","multi-armed bandit","epsilon-greedy","Softmax","奖赏"],"content":"多臂老虎机例子说明：探索用于估计不同选择的优劣，利用选择当前已知收益最优的选择。课件比较只探索和只利用的不足，并介绍 epsilon-贪心和 Softmax 作为折中策略。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"comparison","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec6_upper_confidence_bound","source_file":"ai_lec6_mcts_and_search_summary.pdf","page_start":19,"page_end":19,"section_title":"上限置信区间（UCB）选择规则","topic_ids":["upper_confidence_bound","exploration_exploitation"],"support_tags":["ucb","empirical_mean","reward_mean","exploration_bonus","visit_count","uncertainty","selection_policy"],"keywords":["UCB","Upper-Confidence Bound","上限置信区间","经验平均收益","探索项","访问次数"],"content":"UCB 在动作 k 的经验平均收益 Q_k 上加入探索项 C·sqrt(ln T / T_k)。随着总体选择次数 T 增长，该项体现继续探索的价值；随着动作 k 已被选择次数 T_k 增加，该项减小。算法优先选择上置信界最大的动作，从而平衡利用当前高收益动作与探索尚不确定的动作。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"algorithm","review_status":"human_verified"},
    {"id":"lec6_mcts_four_stages","source_file":"ai_lec6_mcts_and_search_summary.pdf","page_start":20,"page_end":20,"section_title":"蒙特卡洛树搜索的四个阶段","topic_ids":["monte_carlo_tree_search","upper_confidence_bound","monte_carlo_search"],"support_tags":["selection","expansion","simulation","backpropagation","ucb"],"keywords":["MCTS","选择","扩展","模拟","回溯","UCB"],"content":"课件将 MCTS 划分为四步：从根按选择策略（通常 UCB）下行到叶节点；扩展新子节点；从新节点模拟得到结果；再把奖励均值和访问次数沿路径向上回溯更新。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"algorithm","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec6_mcts_selection_simulation_backpropagation","source_file":"ai_lec6_mcts_and_search_summary.pdf","page_start":32,"page_end":32,"section_title":"MCTS 的选择、扩展模拟与回传","topic_ids":["monte_carlo_tree_search","monte_carlo_search","adversarial_search"],"support_tags":["selection","expansion","simulation","backpropagation","visit_count","win_count","value_statistics"],"keywords":["MCTS","对抗搜索","选择","扩展","模拟","回传","访问次数"],"content":"课件以对抗博弈树为例展示 MCTS 的一次迭代：根据已有统计量选择路径，扩展新节点并进行模拟，再把模拟结果沿访问路径回传，更新节点的访问次数和胜负/价值统计。页面中的分数仅作为节点统计量示例，不在此固定解释其分子、分母或玩家视角。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"example","review_status":"human_verified"},
    {"id":"lec6_adversarial_mcts_statistics","source_file":"ai_lec6_mcts_and_search_summary.pdf","page_start":33,"page_end":33,"section_title":"对抗 MCTS 的节点统计视角","topic_ids":["monte_carlo_tree_search","adversarial_search"],"support_tags":["alternating_players","game_tree","visit_count","value_statistics","simulation_update"],"keywords":["MCTS","对抗搜索","交替行动","博弈树","节点统计","模拟更新"],"content":"课件进一步用双方交替行动的博弈树说明对抗场景中的 MCTS。不同节点记录基于模拟结果得到的统计量，并在新增模拟后更新。由于不同层对应不同玩家，具体统计量的分子分母、玩家视角和更新含义仍需结合授课上下文或原始动画进一步确认。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"example","review_status":"needs_human_review"},
    {"id":"lec6_mcts_to_alphago","source_file":"ai_lec6_mcts_and_search_summary.pdf","page_start":34,"page_end":36,"section_title":"MCTS 到 AlphaGo","topic_ids":["monte_carlo_tree_search","game_state_evaluation"],"support_tags":["AlphaGo","policy_network","neural_network","reinforcement_learning"],"keywords":["AlphaGo","MCTS","策略网络","神经网络","强化学习"],"content":"课件指出 MCTS 能通过采样与模拟处理围棋，但仍面对巨大动作空间和模拟到终局的成本。AlphaGo 的例子结合蒙特卡洛搜索、神经网络和强化学习，用策略网络辅助扩展，并用网络直接评估节点。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"application","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec6_game_ai_applications","source_file":"ai_lec6_mcts_and_search_summary.pdf","page_start":37,"page_end":42,"section_title":"博弈 AI 应用与大模型讨论","topic_ids":["adversarial_search","monte_carlo_tree_search","llm_search_and_test_time_scaling"],"support_tags":["checkers","chess","go","starcraft","dota","llm_game_agents"],"keywords":["博弈AI","跳棋","国际象棋","围棋","AlphaStar","大模型"],"content":"课件概述跳棋、国际象棋、围棋、星际争霸和 DOTA2 等博弈 AI 案例，并把大模型能否承担博弈 AI 任务列为扩展讨论与文献方向，而非给出其已被课程验证的通用结论。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"application","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"lec6_search_summary","source_file":"ai_lec6_mcts_and_search_summary.pdf","page_start":43,"page_end":44,"section_title":"搜索算法单元总结","topic_ids":["breadth_first_search","depth_first_search","uniform_cost_search","a_star_search","hill_climbing","evolutionary_search","adversarial_search","monte_carlo_tree_search"],"support_tags":["search_summary","implementation","game_ai"],"keywords":["小结","DFS","BFS","UCS","A*","爬山搜索","演化搜索","博弈搜索"],"content":"单元小结要求掌握 DFS、BFS、UCS 和 A* 的常见实现，掌握爬山和演化搜索的基本实现，并了解博弈搜索思想以解决黑白棋、五子棋、象棋等现实博弈问题。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"course_core","content_type":"historical_context","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"support_stack_lifo","source_file":"ds_stack_queue_priority_queue.pdf","page_start":1,"page_end":2,"section_title":"栈与 LIFO：DFS 先修补充","topic_ids":["depth_first_search"],"support_tags":["stack","lifo","push","pop","prerequisite_support"],"keywords":["栈","stack","LIFO","push","pop","DFS"],"content":"先修材料说明栈是只能在一端插入和删除的线性表，遵循后进先出。它帮助理解 AI 课件中 DFS 为何可用栈实现，但不替代 AI 课件对 DFS 搜索策略的定义。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"prerequisite_support","content_type":"implementation_support","review_status":"codex_draft"},
    {"id":"support_stack_recursion","source_file":"ds_stack_queue_priority_queue.pdf","page_start":3,"page_end":6,"section_title":"递归调用栈：DFS 先修补充","topic_ids":["depth_first_search"],"support_tags":["stack","recursion","call_stack","prerequisite_support"],"keywords":["递归","调用栈","stack","递归函数","DFS"],"content":"先修材料以递归函数为例解释每次调用的活动记录入栈、返回时出栈。这帮助理解递归式 DFS 的执行机制，但不将数据结构调用栈等同于 AI 课件中的状态空间定义。","language":"bilingual","source_role":"prerequisite_support","content_type":"implementation_support","review_status":"codex_draft"},
